<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major>Supply SH-20 Ballistic Shield Backpack</Major>
    <Description>The SH-20 Ballistic Shield Backpack or Ballistic Shield for short is a Stratagem which provides portable cover against enemy small arms fire when wielded.

Instructions:
To make the macro work correctly, set the stratagem button to the «click» type. In the game settings, select the arrows for the stratagems.

The tactical advantage of using the arrow keys is that you can keep moving while entering a stratagem sequence.
</Description>
    <Comment></Comment>
    <GUIOption>
      <RepeatType>0</RepeatType>
    </GUIOption>
